#. Runtime JSON key: operation_files.result_contract
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "- 结果: 通常返回简要摘要。成功的 `search_control` 调用及 `colony_control` 的 `domain=bio bioDomain=farming action=seed_catalog|list_planting` 或 `domain=management kind=research action=list` 读取（包括现有路由别名）保留完整子结果。其他殖民地读取和写入默认仍返回摘要。`detail=brief|compact|full` 保持原生搜索粒度含义。布尔值 `detail=false` 抑制结果输出；`detail=true` 还返回参数及完整结果或错误。请用 `query`/`limit` 缩小范围；数量和截断信息保持子工具报告的原样。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.OPERATION_FILES.RESULT_CONTRACT"
msgid "- result: compact summaries normally. Successful `search_control` calls and `colony_control` reads for `domain=bio bioDomain=farming action=seed_catalog|list_planting` or `domain=management kind=research action=list` retain the complete child result, including existing route aliases. Other colony reads/writes stay compact by default. Search `detail=brief|compact|full` keeps its native meaning. Boolean `detail=false` suppresses result output; `detail=true` also echoes arguments and retains full results/errors. Narrow results with `query`/`limit`; counts and truncation remain as reported by the child."
msgstr ""

